  "posts": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "authorId": "u_athlete",
      "content": "Three hours on court in that heat and we found a way. Thank you to everyone who stayed to the last point — I felt it. On to the quarters.",
      "sport": "tennis",
      "imageUrl": "/assets/images/tennis-ball.jpg",
      "imageAlt": "Close-up of a tennis ball resting on a hard court",
      "photoKey": "ball",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-31T07:02:58.454Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "authorId": "u_coach",
      "content": "The second-serve numbers tell the whole story today: 71% won behind it. That is what months of work looks like under pressure.",
      "sport": "tennis",
      "imageUrl": "/assets/images/clay-lines.jpg",
      "imageAlt": "White tennis court lines crossing on red clay",
      "photoKey": "clay",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-31T04:02:58.454Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "authorId": "u_trusted",
      "content": "Tough draw for Volkov next round, but honestly the way she's returning right now I wouldn't bet against her.",
      "sport": "tennis",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-31T00:02:58.454Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "authorId": "u_fan",
      "content": "First time watching live and the atmosphere on the show court is unreal. Respect to both players — that was a battle.",
      "sport": "tennis",
      "imageUrl": "/assets/images/stadium.jpg",
      "imageAlt": "Wide view of an outdoor tennis stadium during a match",
      "photoKey": "stadium",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-30T08:02:58.454Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "authorId": "u_athlete",
      "content": "Recovery day. Ice, physio, and a lot of gratitude. The messages after last night's match meant more than you know.",
      "sport": "tennis",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-30T03:02:58.454Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "authorId": "u_coach",
      "content": "Reminder that a bad line call is part of the game. Disagree loudly, sure — but the umpire is doing a hard job in real time.",
      "sport": "tennis",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T06:02:58.454Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "authorId": "u_tennisdesk",
      "content": "Backhand detail: the preparation is finished before the bounce. That early shoulder turn is what buys time under pressure.",
      "sport": "tennis",
      "imageUrl": "/assets/images/player-action.jpg",
      "imageAlt": "Tennis player striking a backhand during a professional match on a blue hard court",
      "photoKey": "action",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T23:02:58.454Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "p8",
      "authorId": "u_footballer",
      "content": "Tough result, but the analysis starts with us. We were too slow moving the ball after half-time. Back to work tomorrow.",
      "sport": "football",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-31T05:02:58.454Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "p9",
      "authorId": "u_rugby",
      "content": "That final defensive set was outstanding. You can disagree with the referee and still keep the conversation about the decision, not the person.",
      "sport": "rugby",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-30T22:02:58.454Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "p10",
      "authorId": "u_motorsport",
      "content": "A brave strategy call that did not pay off today. Criticise the decision all you like; abuse of drivers and team staff adds nothing to the debate.",
      "sport": "motorsport",
      "moderationStatus": "clean",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-30T06:02:58.455Z"
    }
